Package: minios-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: elementary-minios-icon-theme
Description: MiniOS shared GUI styling (canonical stylesheet)
 Common look-and-feel resources shared by the MiniOS graphical applications —
 minios-installer, minios-configurator, driveutility and the other minios-*
 GTK tools.
 .
 It installs /usr/share/minios/minios.css, the canonical MiniOS application
 stylesheet. Applications load this file on top of the active GTK theme to get
 consistent header bar, sidebar, content card, button, banner, badge, list and
 progress styling across the whole product. Surfaces derive from the running
 theme, so both light and dark desktops are supported; only the primary action
 and brand accents use the fixed MiniOS blue.
 .
 This package provides styling resources only. It does not modify the
 applications, which adopt the stylesheet by loading it explicitly.

Package: python3-minios-gui
Section: python
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.6),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         minios-gui (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Python 3 helpers for MiniOS GTK applications
 Shared Python 3.6-compatible GTK 3 helpers for MiniOS graphical applications.
 The module provides canonical stylesheet loading, icon-theme resolution,
 standard message and confirmation dialogs, reusable HeaderBar and semantic
 status-banner widgets, compact module-presentation helpers, a read-only
 streamed log view, parser-free compiled document rendering, background command
 execution and a cancellable command dialog.
 .
 This binary package is built from the minios-gui source repository together
 with the canonical MiniOS application stylesheet.
